000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. FIGCON2.
000030 DATA DIVISION.
000040 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000050 01  END-KEY             PIC X(6)  VALUE HIGH-VALUES.
000060 01  START-KEY           PIC X(6)  VALUE LOW-VALUES.
000070 01  CUST-KEY            PIC X(6)  VALUE "SMITH".
000080 01  STARS               PIC X(6)  VALUE ALL "*".
000090 01  PATTERN             PIC X(6)  VALUE "ABABAB".
000100 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000110     IF END-KEY = HIGH-VALUES
000120         DISPLAY "END-KEY = HIGH-VALUES"
