000190     END-IF
000200     IF STARS = ALL "*"
000210         DISPLAY "STARS = ALL ""*"""
000220     END-IF
000230     IF PATTERN = ALL "AB"
000240         DISPLAY "PATTERN = ALL ""AB"""
000250     END-IF
000260     MOVE "X" TO STARS (6:1)
000270     IF STARS NOT = ALL "*"
000280         DISPLAY "ONE BYTE CHANGED: STARS NOT = ALL ""*"""
000290     END-IF
000300     STOP RUN.
